                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gummeré to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-06-22"><hi rendition="#italic">June 22,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Gummeré states that the Italian minister announces the ratification by the
                    Sultan of the general act without reserve on the 18th instant.)</p>


